<title>USA: Mexico seeks 29,000 T U.S. HRW wheat - exporters.</title>
<headline>Mexico seeks 29,000 T U.S. HRW wheat - exporters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico was scheduled to tender overnight for 29,000 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat, 13.5 percent protein, for April shipment, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>It seeks 20,000 tonnes to be delivered by ship to the west coast of Mexico and 9,000 tonnes to be delivered by rail.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
